{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dungeon Holdem is the poker dungeon crawler where every hand is a weapon, and your deck is your survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566130/extras/9da2be93a22830eba8401216725be751.poster.avif?t=1770107455\" width=780 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566130/extras/9da2be93a22830eba8401216725be751.webm?t=1770107455\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566130/extras/9da2be93a22830eba8401216725be751.mp4?t=1770107455\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why settle for a single hand when you can stack them?</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Dungeon Holdem, one hand can be many \u2014 every stacked combo multiplies your damage into devastating blows.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A full house isn\u2019t just one win, it\u2019s a cascade of combos stacked into a single devastating strike.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape your deck to draw hands within hands, every layer adding lethal force.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each stacked layer multiplies your damage, turning one draw into an unstoppable poker onslaught.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566130/extras/c2cb1bb97f3d958130d787ec879b81b1.poster.avif?t=1770107455\" width=780 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566130/extras/c2cb1bb97f3d958130d787ec879b81b1.webm?t=1770107455\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566130/extras/c2cb1bb97f3d958130d787ec879b81b1.mp4?t=1770107455\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every ability you buy or sell can rewrite your hand\u2019s impact. Mix and match skills for infinite synergies, then define your playstyle by choosing the Way of the Warrior or the Path of the Wizard.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scale your power exponentially with critical hits for devastating multipliers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bend poker rules to chain combos, draw extra cards, or ignore suit restrictions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boost your stats mid-battle, amplifying hand strength and survivability.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash devastating poker-charged attacks based on your strongest draws.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sell unwanted abilities between runs to fund new ones and hone your strategy.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566130/extras/b52c77ad48bd2ea058bddf6a4561f7a6.poster.avif?t=1770107455\" width=780 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566130/extras/b52c77ad48bd2ea058bddf6a4561f7a6.webm?t=1770107455\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566130/extras/b52c77ad48bd2ea058bddf6a4561f7a6.mp4?t=1770107455\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delve deeper into the dungeon to face ever-more-powerful foes, each with unique special effects that force you to adapt your deck and tactics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll encounter grim reapers, zombies, mummies, orcs, goblins, ghouls, vampires, wraiths, and more\u2014each with its own twisted challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566130/extras/9325e4745d76e4a0ef50eca2f7db01d7.poster.avif?t=1770107455\" width=780 height=560 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566130/extras/9325e4745d76e4a0ef50eca2f7db01d7.webm?t=1770107455\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566130/extras/9325e4745d76e4a0ef50eca2f7db01d7.mp4?t=1770107455\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After each round, visit the shop to spend your hard-earned loot:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy new abilities to expand your strategic toolkit</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade hand power, amplifying every combo\u2019s impact</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock unique deck effects\u2014card transformations, draw boosters, suit bonuses\u2014to tailor your build</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trim your deck, sharpen your odds, and stack hands your way</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566130/extras/c381041e36baff7c80ace3f55703b65f.poster.avif?t=1770107455\" width=780 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566130/extras/c381041e36baff7c80ace3f55703b65f.webm?t=1770107455\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566130/extras/c381041e36baff7c80ace3f55703b65f.mp4?t=1770107455\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With over 100 abilities, 10 hand upgrades, 30 consumables, 20 passives, and 20 unique monsters, Dungeon Holdem delivers endless strategy and challenge. Descend into the poker dungeon crawler and forge the ultimate deck\u2014will you master the cards and claim victory?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566130/extras/6d8fc0070e8306fc59d8cbd8ae5723d5.poster.avif?t=1770107455\" width=780 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566130/extras/6d8fc0070e8306fc59d8cbd8ae5723d5.webm?t=1770107455\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566130/extras/6d8fc0070e8306fc59d8cbd8ae5723d5.mp4?t=1770107455\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3566130?t=1770107455","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566130/52584dafdc6dde55c4143fa68f9255a4d7007412/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770107455","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566130/c35c10d7591b6637700365e59ad290d9dabb6b13/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770107455","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566130/c35c10d7591b6637700365e59ad290d9dabb6b13/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770107455","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dungeon Holdem is the poker dungeon crawler where every hand is a weapon, and your deck is your survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566130/extras/9da2be93a22830eba8401216725be751.poster.avif?t=1770107455\" width=780 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566130/extras/9da2be93a22830eba8401216725be751.webm?t=1770107455\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566130/extras/9da2be93a22830eba8401216725be751.mp4?t=1770107455\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why settle for a single hand when you can stack them?</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Dungeon Holdem, one hand can be many \u2014 every stacked combo multiplies your damage into devastating blows.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A full house isn\u2019t just one win, it\u2019s a cascade of combos stacked into a single devastating strike.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape your deck to draw hands within hands, every layer adding lethal force.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each stacked layer multiplies your damage, turning one draw into an unstoppable poker onslaught.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566130/extras/c2cb1bb97f3d958130d787ec879b81b1.poster.avif?t=1770107455\" width=780 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566130/extras/c2cb1bb97f3d958130d787ec879b81b1.webm?t=1770107455\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566130/extras/c2cb1bb97f3d958130d787ec879b81b1.mp4?t=1770107455\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every ability you buy or sell can rewrite your hand\u2019s impact. Mix and match skills for infinite synergies, then define your playstyle by choosing the Way of the Warrior or the Path of the Wizard.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scale your power exponentially with critical hits for devastating multipliers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bend poker rules to chain combos, draw extra cards, or ignore suit restrictions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boost your stats mid-battle, amplifying hand strength and survivability.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash devastating poker-charged attacks based on your strongest draws.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sell unwanted abilities between runs to fund new ones and hone your strategy.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566130/extras/b52c77ad48bd2ea058bddf6a4561f7a6.poster.avif?t=1770107455\" width=780 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566130/extras/b52c77ad48bd2ea058bddf6a4561f7a6.webm?t=1770107455\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566130/extras/b52c77ad48bd2ea058bddf6a4561f7a6.mp4?t=1770107455\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delve deeper into the dungeon to face ever-more-powerful foes, each with unique special effects that force you to adapt your deck and tactics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll encounter grim reapers, zombies, mummies, orcs, goblins, ghouls, vampires, wraiths, and more\u2014each with its own twisted challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566130/extras/9325e4745d76e4a0ef50eca2f7db01d7.poster.avif?t=1770107455\" width=780 height=560 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566130/extras/9325e4745d76e4a0ef50eca2f7db01d7.webm?t=1770107455\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566130/extras/9325e4745d76e4a0ef50eca2f7db01d7.mp4?t=1770107455\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After each round, visit the shop to spend your hard-earned loot:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy new abilities to expand your strategic toolkit</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade hand power, amplifying every combo\u2019s impact</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock unique deck effects\u2014card transformations, draw boosters, suit bonuses\u2014to tailor your build</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trim your deck, sharpen your odds, and stack hands your way</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566130/extras/c381041e36baff7c80ace3f55703b65f.poster.avif?t=1770107455\" width=780 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566130/extras/c381041e36baff7c80ace3f55703b65f.webm?t=1770107455\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566130/extras/c381041e36baff7c80ace3f55703b65f.mp4?t=1770107455\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With over 100 abilities, 10 hand upgrades, 30 consumables, 20 passives, and 20 unique monsters, Dungeon Holdem delivers endless strategy and challenge. Descend into the poker dungeon crawler and forge the ultimate deck\u2014will you master the cards and claim victory?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566130/extras/6d8fc0070e8306fc59d8cbd8ae5723d5.poster.avif?t=1770107455\" width=780 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566130/extras/6d8fc0070e8306fc59d8cbd8ae5723d5.webm?t=1770107455\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566130/extras/6d8fc0070e8306fc59d8cbd8ae5723d5.mp4?t=1770107455\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Destined","James Oliver"],"genres":[{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566130/0d407417df9f268ade8a4d8b4408000a44ed37e8/header.jpg?t=1770107455","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 18 or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core2 Duo 2.4Ghz or Higher / AMD 3Ghz or Higher<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia 8600 / Radeon equivalent (2009 era)<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Any standard soundcard!</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3566130/639885251/d4b1cce57100bcb7e26fb0aac0d5b9ba93c2877b/1755243096/dash_av1.mpd?t=1761209594","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3566130/639885251/d4b1cce57100bcb7e26fb0aac0d5b9ba93c2877b/1755243096/dash_h264.mpd?t=1761209594","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3566130/639885251/d4b1cce57100bcb7e26fb0aac0d5b9ba93c2877b/1755243096/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1761209594","id":257181957,"name":"Dungeon Hol